NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/delegate.Options#GateClaim kind=field
  digest=b3:e5d26f57b9e4fbb61a76aead1d1ee422e7af33223b0e30c24ff98fc77377d837 file=neo/internal/delegate/client.go range=54:62 lang=go exported=true byte_range=2304:2902
  sig=func(intentID string, nodeID string) bool
  doc=GateClaim, when non-nil, is consulted before this client answers an\napproval gate. It returns true if THIS client may service\n(intentID, nodeID); false if another delegate client (a concurrent\nattach to the same in-flight intent) already claimed it. It must be\nsafe for concurrent use and is shared across the per-call clients the\nengine constructs, so two attaches to the same intent cannot\ndouble-answer the same gate. nil falls back to the client's per-run\nanswered set (single-run dedup only — the CLI / test path).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/delegate.Options

